  "goodToKnow": "Die Schulung is a training course, often at work: eine Schulung zum Brandschutz, eine Software-Schulung. Synonyms: die Fortbildung (further training), die Weiterbildung, das Training. The verb schulen means to train: geschultes Personal (trained staff), ein geschultes Auge (a trained eye). In Germany, many workplace Schulungen, such as on safety, are legally required. Plural: die Schulungen."
